  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Corporate engagement for mining affected communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to empower mining-affected communities, strengthen corporate accountability, and advocate for social and economic justice in South Africa and the broader Southern Africa region. The project will support community-led monitoring, engagement with corporations and government, and regional advocacy to ensure mining activities respect human rights, environmental sustainability, and economic equity.</narrative>
  </description>
